--//  * AUTO-MUTE: anything that spams (remote, sound, GUI text, new objects...) is detected and muted automatically.
--//  * MUTED panel (right side): shows what got muted and how fast it spammed. Click an entry to unmute it.
--//  * DECODED output: buffers are shown as hex + ASCII + numbers (u8 / i16 / i32 / f32 views), JSON strings are decoded,
--//    tables are printed fully, Vector3/CFrame/Color3/etc. are readable. Nothing is left as raw "buffer".
